      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sorry about that! We've changed how reproduction steps are submitted. Here are the steps you have us:\n\n1. Boot SteamVR and only turn on one controller (right Index Controller used here) and one or more trackers (HTC Vive Tracker 2.0 used).\n\n2. Launch VRChat.\n\n3. Observe that you are immobile once you load in and cannot move. \n\n(4. Open the action menu and observe that one-handed controls appear by (one of) the tracker(s).)\n\nBinding the trackers to body parts in the SteamVR \"manage trackers\" menu seems to have no effect on this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
