  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A hand injury has made me greatly appreciate VRChat's one-handed mode, but I've come across a small issue I'd like to report.\n\nIf entering VR with only one hand controller and any trackers on, a tracker will always be assigned as the \"other hand.\" This is evident by one-handed controls appearing by that tracker when opening the Action Menu.\n\nIdeally, it should be possible to enter FBT with only one hand, but otherwise having trackers active should not be considered as another hand.",
